id: pm-gh1562
title: "GH-1562: expose calendar matching totals and bounded continuation"
description: "Reported on2026.10.23: runCalendar limit2 returns two of three reminders while exposing only post-limit summaries and filters.limit, with no total, omission receipt, has_more or bounded continuation. Investigate core SDK completeness metadata and recoverable bounded reads, without claiming stored data loss."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: agent-ux,"gh:1562",sdk
created_at: "2026-10-23T15:20:50.258Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T16:16:51.001Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-24T16:16:49.170Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-24T16:16:49.170Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: A limited calendar result discloses matching versus returned scope and omissions; callers can recover omitted rows through bounded continuation or a concrete bounded recovery with stated consistency limits; public CalendarResult types describe the completeness fields; sandboxed reminder and deadline controls cover exact-full and truncated windows without stored data loss.
parent: pm-qh3p
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "CalendarResult exposes matching/returned/remaining counts, page offset, has_more and next_cursor from a frozen relative clock. Summaries and day buckets explicitly describe returned_rows; public SDK and calendar CLI/MCP share the contract, including a zero-limit Markdown explanation and stale-set refusal."
expected_result: "A limited calendar read distinguishes exact-full, truncated, empty and counts-only results and retrieves omitted rows using bounded continuation with stated consistency limits."
actual_result: "The current linked38-test calendar suite passes direct SDK, CLI, MCP and package continuation, ties, page-size changes, empty/exact-full/zero limits, relative clock freezing and stale-set controls. Counts-only Markdown requests limit1or greater instead of falsely claiming no matches. The identical pre-fix completeness test fails. Full suite before the final presentation delta passes11206tests at exact100percent all metrics; the final full rerun and exact-head hosted checks/review remain required merge gates."
affected_version: 2026.10.23
